---
import Page from '../../layouts/page.astro';
---
<Page title="Hosting guide — Platfolio">
  <article class="ui-prose">
    <h1>Hosting guide</h1>
    <ol>
      <li>Sign in to the hub and create or select a team. A team owner can <a href="/dashboard/launch">launch private Platfolio</a> in their own Railway workspace.</li>
      <li>Save the first sign-in instructions. Open the private workspace and complete the owner setup.</li>
      <li>Open Connections to set up secret storage and connect to the marketplace. Choose a platform and release in the private workspace.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>The hosting provider bills your team directly. Your private workspace holds app configuration and credentials. You can disconnect from the marketplace and keep running the releases you have already installed.</p>
    <p><a href="/docs/self-host">Run and restore a platform with Docker Compose</a></p>
  </article>
</Page>
